abstract: >-
  Metalcyte analyses single-cell RNA-seq data on Macs with Apple silicon. You call it from
  Python, and its calculations run in Rust. It runs
  preprocessing, PCA, neighbour graphs, UMAP, t-SNE, clustering and marker gene tests on the
  CPU cores, the AMX matrix coprocessor and the GPU. It can also analyse datasets larger than
  memory, by reading the count matrix from disk in blocks.
